OL,3,GNEWSAThe captain who helped to rescue
OL,4,ATitanic survivors
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen RMS Titanic hit an iceberg at
OL,7,Fabout 23:40 BST on 14 April 1912, it
OL,8,Fwas not until an hour later that an
OL,9,Femergency call went out to other ships
OL,10,Fin the area.
OL,12,FThe morse code message was picked up by
OL,13,Fthe RMS Carpathia which was on its way
OL,14,Fto Gibraltar from New York.
OL,16,FIt was captained by Arthur Rostron from
OL,17,FBolton.
OL,19,FHis story is the subject of a new
OL,20,Fepisode of Hidden Manchester on BBC
OL,21,FSounds.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
